  "contentHtml": "<p>수행평가로 만들었는데 문제는 아주 쉽고~ 아이들의 반응은 좋았던 평가였습니다.</p><p>문제 변형하시고픈 선생님들은 문제만들었던 PPT도 함께 첨부했으니 수정하시면 됩니다.</p><p>쳇GPT한테 그림그려달라고 해서 제작했고&#160;</p><p>시험중간에 시간재면서 &#39;무궁화 꽃이 피었습니다.~&#39; BGM들려줬더니 아이들이 좋아하더라구요.</p><p>문제가 너무 쉬워서 다음해에는 조금 난이도를 높혀야겠다는 생각만 하고, 다른 학년을 맡고 있네요.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7155f820464b979cfe435188e5e06875225393f7?download\" data-file-name=\"[수행연습]오징어게임.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1944576\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D1521%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20260608104047&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F7155f820464b979cfe435188e5e06875225393f7')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[수행연습]오징어게임</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.85MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c169faf010ab3953bc13005a4bc4ee0a064ba025?download\" data-file-name=\"[수행평가]오징어게임(인쇄).hwp\" data-file-size=\"3935232\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D1521%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20260608104047&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc169faf010ab3953bc13005a4bc4ee0a064ba025')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[수행평가]오징어게임(인쇄)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.75MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/321f9014d3b1ae1890d156a384a715326e75c923?download\" data-file-name=\"[수행평가]오징어게임(정답).hwp\" data-file-size=\"3973632\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a hr